# A full report holds every transcript: the person's own words, tool arguments, page text, the names
# in their memories, conversation and thread ids. Nothing in this folder is committed except a public
# report (run.ts --public <report.json>), which is built field by field from verdicts and the texts
# of cases.yaml, and this file.
*
!.gitignore
!*-public.md
!*-public.json
# A fake-mode report is a self-test of the runner, not a result.
*fake*
